# The same Enthralling Hold against a tapped Grizzly Bears: the line's
# ValidTarget$ Creature.untapped does not match it, so it is the one legal
# target. The Aura resolves, attaches, and `GainControl$ You` hands the Bears
# to ai. Once the Aura is on the stack the Stack-zone line is dead
# (getSpellMatchingHost), so the resolution re-check does not refuse it.
startturn ai
advance 3
tapformana ai 2 U
tapformana ai 3 U
tapformana ai 4 U
tapformana ai 5 U
tapformana ai 6 U
queue paygeneric U
queue paygeneric U
queue paygeneric U
queue action ai cast 7
passpriority
